# Icons and images

Use icons and images to help people recognise a device or room quickly. Keep each one tied to a real task: identifying a light, checking a camera or finding a room.

## Choose the right kind of image

Use [Illustration](illustration.html) for authored explanatory artwork. Its flat style does not remove functional icon strokes, chart hatching, photographs or camera images. Write alternative text and set reading order using [Images](../content/formatting-content/images.html) and [Text formatting](../content/formatting-content/text-formatting.html).

